          <strong class="text-navy-900">Why Maruti holds.</strong> Service network density. Maruti has more workshops than any other brand in India. Spare parts are cheap and widely available even in tier 3 and tier 4 towns. That ubiquity makes used Maruti hatchbacks the default choice for first-time buyers and budget-conscious families.
